                Dominion - You still believe you're resisting us. You're not. All we've done is grease the wheels and tilt the scales.:
                Dominion - Every choice you've made... was predicted. Every rebellion... accounted for.:
                Dominion - We don't cause your destruction. You enact it. We only represent the shape of the end you were always walking toward.:
                Dominion - You speak of curses as if they were chains. But the Cursed Couplet was the only thing holding your reality together, two bracelets, Void and Existence, bound in perfect tension.:
                Dominion - A curse not of punishment... but of balance. And you broke it. Not out of necessity. Not out of insight.:
                Dominion - But because humans cannot accept a system they did not design. You shatter what sustains you, then call the ruins 'freedom.':
                Dominion - We did not break your world. You did. We are only the consequence you summoned...:
                Dominion - And now you face the ultimate choice, the choice you've always faced without realizing. Do nothing and face annihilation, or continue and face it anyway.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - edict ("Follow what's in front of you. The rest doesn't concern you."):
